WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:02.626
Aa chhe Hisaab, ek minute ma.

00:00:02.646 --> 00:00:09.556
Tamara chopda tamara potana PC par. Koi
account nahi. Free.

00:00:10.357 --> 00:00:14.511
Tamari company Tally mathi ek step ma aave
chhe.

00:00:15.082 --> 00:00:19.646
Ane Hisaab saabit kare chhe ke darek balance
match thay chhe.

00:00:20.726 --> 00:00:26.376
Jaanit keys: V, F8, ane thodi seconds ma GST
invoice.

00:00:30.804 --> 00:00:33.700
Print karo, ke WhatsApp par moklo.

00:00:34.847 --> 00:00:39.229
B thi Balance Sheet khule chhe, ane Enter thi
andar jao:

00:00:39.259 --> 00:00:43.362
group, party, mahino, ane voucher sudhi.

00:00:46.799 --> 00:00:54.559
GSTR-1, GSTR-3B ane e-TDS sidha tamara
vouchers parthi.

00:00:55.639 --> 00:00:59.300
Hindi ke Gujarati ma screen, e j keys sathe.

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:05.798
Darroj jaate backup, ane tamara potana cloud
ma copy.

00:01:06.778 --> 00:01:10.214
Hisaab: tamara chopda, tamari keys.

00:01:10.234 --> 00:01:14.683
Das nana chapter juo, ane aaje j sharu karo.

